# 31. IMPORTANT INTERPRETATION OF 10/10

10/10 does NOT mean:

"Zero bugs exist anywhere in the universe."

It means:

> "After the verification actually performed, no known material production-blocking defect remains, core workflows are verified, major attack surfaces have been reviewed, and the product represents a strong launch-ready implementation."

Never claim impossible certainty.

